## How this repository works

This project runs under the Spec-Driven Development Framework; the governing
edition is committed at the repo root as {{EDITION_FILE}}. Work proceeds one
spec at a time: specs/STATUS.md is the current state, specs/NNNN-*.md are the
contracts, DECISIONS.md records the architecture decisions, and main is always
shippable. Feature work happens on spec/NNNN-<slug> branches and merges only
through the close gate.

